<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Attestation de Présence</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        @page {
            size: A4 portrait;
            margin: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f7faf5;
            width: 595px;
            height: 842px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .certificate-border {
            position: absolute;
            top: 28px;
            left: 28px;
            right: 28px;
            bottom: 28px;
            background-color: #1f7054;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .certificate-inner {
            position: absolute;
            top: 42px;
            left: 42px;
            right: 42px;
            bottom: 42px;
            background-color: #fcfcfa;
            border-radius: 2px;
            padding: 30px 50px;
        }

        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #47705a;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .header-block {
            background-color: #e0edde;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 24px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .header-title {
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 26px;
            color: #1c4a38;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .header-subtitle {
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #577364;
        }

        .body-section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .certify-text {
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #4d6158;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .participant-name {
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #1f3d33;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .participated-text {
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #365245;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .event-title {
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #214770;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .details-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0 0 30px 0;
        }

        .details-list li {
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #40524a;
            padding: 6px 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .details-list li strong {
            color: #2c3e36;
        }

        .footer-block {
            background-color: #f2e6c9;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .reference {
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #735421;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .footer-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .footer-row .date,
        .footer-row .signature {
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6b5c3a;
        }

        .closing {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .closing p {
            font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #577364;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="certificate-border"></div>
    <div class="certificate-inner">
        <div class="logo">ARDHI</div>

        <div class="header-block">
            <div class="header-title">ATTESTATION DE PRÉSENCE</div>
            <div class="header-subtitle">Document officiel de participation aux événements Ardhi</div>
        </div>

        <div class="body-section">
            <p class="certify-text">Cette attestation certifie que</p>
            <p class="participant-name">{{ participantName }}</p>
            <p class="participated-text">a effectivement participé à l'événement suivant :</p>
            <p class="event-title">{{ eventTitle }}</p>

            <ul class="details-list">
                <li><strong>Lieu :</strong> {{ location }}</li>
                <li><strong>Dates :</strong> {{ dates }}</li>
                <li><strong>Organisateur :</strong> {{ organizer }}</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-block">
            <div class="reference">Référence : {{ reference }}</div>
            <div class="footer-row">
                <span class="date">Date d'émission : {{ issuedAt }}</span>
                <span class="signature">Signature : Ardhi Événements</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="closing">
            <p>Merci pour votre engagement et votre présence.</p>
            <p>Cette attestation a été générée automatiquement par la plateforme Ardhi.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
